div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203713\">タクシーはカタツムリと<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じくらいのろのろ<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>すす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいるように<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">出租车似乎正走得像一根&lt;unk&gt;子一样。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">呑気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のんき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轻松；随和；无忧无虑；乐观；悠闲；粗心；欠考虑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142823\"><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれつき<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にのんきな<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是个出生而有趣的男人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n2:v:把握\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">把握</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はあく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">掌握；把握</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">まず<ruby>現状<rp>(</rp><rt>げんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>正確<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>把握<rp>(</rp><rt>はあく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">首先需要准确把握现状。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">灰色</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はいいろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/